 justify-center transition-opacity opacity-0"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="animate-spin size-4 text-[color:inherit]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle class="opacity-25" cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4"></circle><path class="opacity-75" d="M4 12a8 8 0 018-8V0C5.373 0 0 5.373 0 12h4z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span><span class="inline-flex items-center whitespace-nowrap" style="opacity:1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" data-icon="icon-more" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" display="flex" role="img" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12c0-1.1.9-2 2-2s2 .9 2 2-.9 2-2 2-2-.9-2-2zm9 2c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2s-.9-2-2-2-2 .9-2 2 .9 2 2 2zm7 0c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2s-.9-2-2-2-2 .9-2 2 .9 2 2 2z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div></div><div dir="auto" class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-text text-body font-normal"><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit">📌 提醒一下：之前绑定过 X 的用户都有空投资格，共计 8 万个链上地址 + 4 万个 X 账号。
记得去检查：</span><a class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-brand text-[length:inherit] font-inherit hover:underline" href="https://app.river.inc/airdrop" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">app.river.inc/airdrop</a><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit">

之前分享过的 RIVER 已经上线了 Binance 永续合约，这可以说是一个阶段性的起点。

目前大多数项目顶多能上 Alpha，再好一点才是 Alpha+Perp，而 RIVER 作为 Binance Wallet 首个超募 $1 亿美金的项目，基本面数据非常硬。最近无论是投票排行还是价格表现，都相当强势。

更值得关注的是它的空投机制：
RIVER 引入了一个动态空投转换机制，让“时间”本身成为代币经济学的一部分。符合资格的用户，能领取的 </span><a class="rounded-xs focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring hover:underline max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] text-brand" data-state="closed" data-slot="hover-card-trigger" href="/search?q=%24RIVER">$<!-- -->RIVER</a><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit"> 数量会随时间延迟而指数级增加，带有明显的博弈性质。
River Pts积分可随时兑换成 RIVER 代币，配合合约可以衍生出更多策略玩法。

从用户角度看是博弈游戏，让社区用户互相揣摩最佳领取时机，本身也能制造讨论热度。从项目方视角，玩法上的创新，它本质上就是一种控筹分布手段、稳住价格、提升用户粘性的思路。</span></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="relative overflow-hidden border border-gray-200 rounded-md" style="aspect-ratio:1.8666666666666667"><div class="relative h-full w-full"><div inert="" class="h-full w-full"><a class="rounded-xs focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] block h-full w-full cursor-zoom-in appearance-none border-none bg-transparent p-0 text-inherit" aria-label="Image" href="/KuiGas/status/1979409696542085392/photo/1"><img fetchPriority="high" height="660" width="1232" alt="" class="w-full" decoding="async" loading="eager" sizes="(max-width: 600px) calc(100vw - 80px), 600px" src="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G3hFaSnXoAAecV5?format=webp&amp;name=large" srcSet="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G3hFaSnXoAAecV5?format=webp&amp;name=small 680w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G3hFaSnXoAAecV5?format=webp&amp;name=medium 1200w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G3hFaSnXoAAecV5?format=webp&amp;name=large 2048w"/></a></div><a aria-label="View media" class="absolute inset-0 z-10" href="/KuiGas/status/1979409696542085392/photo/1"></a></div></div><div class="outline-blue-500 transition-colors focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 overflow-hidden cursor-pointer hover:bg-gray-100/50" data-href="/RiverdotInc/status/1979225134180503601" data-timeline-entry="" role="link" tabindex="0"><article><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 p-3"><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-1"><div class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1"><a class="focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] text-[color:inherit] rounded-none" href="/RiverdotInc"><div class="shrink-0 overflow-hidden bg-neutral-300 rounded-xs size-6 transition duration-200 hover:brightness-90"><img 